          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="An increase in attacks on commercial shipping disrupts shipments of semiconductors, servers and rack equipment, causing delivery delays and cost overruns that depress near-term revenue/profit forecasts for AI infrastructure providers and lower their market valuations." />
