          <attvalue for="35" value="Rapid introduction or escalation of trade/industrial measures (tariffs, export controls, investment screening) raises near-term supply‑chain and geopolitical uncertainty, prompting traders, insurers and lenders to demand higher risk premia in energy and shipping markets." />
